entries.statement:
The source-sensitive strategy seeks an obstruction map
\[
\mathfrak o^r_{X,K}:\operatorname{CH}^r(X)_{\mathbf Q,\mathrm{geom\,hom}}
\longrightarrow\mathcal R_{X,r}^{\vee}
\]
and a reconstruction theorem on its kernel. The general remaining target is \(\mathfrak o^r_{X,K}=0\) on the original homologically trivial Chow source, with all hypotheses of the proposed actual reconstruction verified.
